# 🏭 Industrial Diagnostic AI System — Complete Technical Diagrams

---

## 1. High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph CLIENT["🖥️ Client Layer — React 18 + Vite (Port 5173)"]
        LP[LandingPage\nDataset Selection]
        CP[ChatPage\nDiagnostic Chat Interface]
        AD[AnalysisDashboard\nPerformance Analytics]
        API_JS[api.js\nAxios HTTP Client]
    end

    subgraph BACKEND["⚙️ Backend Layer — FastAPI + Uvicorn (Port 8000)"]
        MAIN[main.py\nFastAPI App + CORS + Lifespan]
        subgraph ROUTES["REST Endpoints"]
            R1[GET /health]
            R2[POST /load-data]
            R3[POST /query]
            R4[GET /analyses]
            R5[GET /analyses/agent-report]
            R6[POST /rebuild-index]
            R7[GET /index-status]
        end
    end

    subgraph AICORE["🧠 AI/ML Core"]
        subgraph RAG["RAG Pipeline"]
            EMB[Embedder\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2]
            FAISS[FAISSStore\nDual Flat-L2 Indexes]
            RET[Retriever\nTop-K Semantic Search]
        end
        subgraph AGENTS["6-Agent Orchestrator"]
            ORCH[AgentOrchestrator]
        end
        LLM[LLMClient\nOllama / OpenAI / Fallback]
    end

    subgraph DATA["💾 Data & Storage Layer"]
        FIQ[FailureIQ Dataset\nCSV + Synthetic]
        AFRB[AFRB Dataset\nCSV Upload]
        FIDX[faiss_indexes/\n.faiss + .pkl]
        SQLDB[SQLite DB\nanalysis_store.db]
        UPLOADS[uploads/\nUser CSVs]
    end

    LP -->|navigate /chat/:dataset| CP
    LP -->|navigate /analysis| AD
    CP --> API_JS
    AD --> API_JS
    API_JS -->|HTTP/JSON| MAIN
    MAIN --> ROUTES
    R3 --> FAISS
    R3 --> ORCH
    R2 --> FIQ
    R2 --> AFRB
    FAISS --> FIDX
    ORCH --> LLM
    FIQ --> EMB --> FAISS
    AFRB --> EMB
    MAIN --> SQLDB
    AFRB --> UPLOADS
```

