## 2. End-to-End Query Execution Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([👤 User Enters Diagnostic Question]) --> B[ChatPage.jsx\nhandleSubmit]
    B --> C[api.js\nPOST /query]
    C --> D{Dataset Loaded?\nFAISS Index Ready?}
    D -->|No| E[❌ HTTP 400\nLoad dataset first]
    D -->|Yes| F[FAISSStore.search\nEmbed query via all-MiniLM-L6-v2]
    F --> G[Top-K Semantic Retrieval\nL2 Distance → Similarity Score]
    G --> H[BaseAgent.format_context\nFormat retrieved docs as numbered list]

    H --> I{PHASE 1 — asyncio.gather}
    I --> J[🧠 DiagnosticExpertAgent\n≥3 Hypotheses + Evidence Scoring]
    I --> K[⚡ AggressiveDecisionAgent\nHeuristic Threshold Rules]
    I --> L[🔍 PatternRecognitionAgent\nFAISS Pattern + Trend Analysis]

    J --> M[evaluate_phase1\nLLM-as-a-Judge ×3 parallel]
    K --> M
    L --> M
    M --> N[Phase 1 Score + Recommendations]

    N --> O[PHASE 2 — ✅ VerificationAnalyst\nCross-validate + Resolve Contradictions]
    O --> P[evaluate_phase2\nLLM Judge + Contradiction Bonus]
    P --> Q[Phase 2 Score + Improvement Delta]

    Q --> R[PHASE 3 — 🎯 AmbiguityDetectionAgent\nConfidence Calibration + Risk Score]
    R --> S[evaluate_phase3\nLLM Judge + Calibration Bonus]
    S --> T{Human Review\nRequired?}
    T -->|Yes| U[🚨 Flag: ambiguity=true]
    T -->|No| V[✅ Proceed]
    U --> W
    V --> W

    W[PHASE 4 — 🏁 HumanReviewCoordinator\nFinal Synthesis + Structured JSON Output]
    W --> X[evaluate_phase4\nLLM Judge + Confidence Weighting]
    X --> Y[build_pipeline_test_summary\nAggregate 4-Phase Score]

    Y --> Z[PHASE 5 — SystemAnalysisAgent\nMeta-evaluation + InlineEvaluationReport]
    Z --> AA[_bg_save_analysis\nBackground: persist to SQLite]
    Z --> AB[QueryResponse JSON\nfinal_diagnosis, confidence,\nreasoning, agent_outputs,\nanalysis_report, phase_test_results]
    AB --> AC[ChatPage renders\nDiagnosisCard + AgentContributions\n+ PhaseTestPanel + ConfidenceBar]
    AC --> AD2([✅ User sees structured result])
```

---

## 3. Multi-Agent Pipeline — Detailed Interaction Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant ORC as AgentOrchestrator
    participant DE as 🧠 DiagnosticExpert
    participant AD as ⚡ AggressiveDecision
    participant PR as 🔍 PatternRecognition
    participant PE as 📊 PhaseEvaluator
    participant VA as ✅ VerificationAnalyst
    participant AM as 🎯 AmbiguityDetection
    participant HC as 🏁 HumanReviewCoord
    participant SA as 🔬 SystemAnalysis
    participant LLM as 🤖 LLMClient

    ORC->>DE: run(question, context)
    ORC->>AD: run(question, context)
    ORC->>PR: run(question, context, retrieval_scores)
    Note over DE,PR: Phase 1 — asyncio.gather (parallel)

    DE->>LLM: generate(hypotheses_prompt)
    AD->>LLM: generate(heuristic_prompt)
    PR->>LLM: generate(pattern_prompt)
    LLM-->>DE: JSON {hypotheses, primary_hypothesis, confidence}
    LLM-->>AD: JSON {decision, heuristic_rules, immediate_action}
    LLM-->>PR: JSON {patterns, dominant_failure_signature, trend_analysis}

    DE-->>ORC: diag_result
    AD-->>ORC: aggr_result
    PR-->>ORC: pattern_result

    ORC->>PE: evaluate_phase1(diag, aggr, pattern, context)
    PE->>LLM: judge(faithfulness) × 3 parallel
    PE->>LLM: judge(reasoning) × 3 parallel
    PE->>LLM: judge(coverage) × 3 parallel
    PE->>LLM: judge(hallucination) × 3 parallel
    PE->>LLM: judge(agreement) × 3 parallel
    PE-->>ORC: phase1_eval {score, verdict, recommendations}

    ORC->>VA: run(question, context, {phase1 agents + phase1_test})
    VA->>LLM: generate(verification_prompt)
    LLM-->>VA: JSON {agreements, contradictions_resolved, verified_diagnosis}
    VA-->>ORC: ver_result

    ORC->>PE: evaluate_phase2(ver_result, phase1_evals, context)
    PE-->>ORC: phase2_eval

    ORC->>AM: run(question, context, {verification + phase2_test})
    AM->>LLM: generate(ambiguity_prompt)
    LLM-->>AM: JSON {conflicts, overall_confidence, human_review_required}
    AM-->>ORC: amb_result

    ORC->>PE: evaluate_phase3(amb_result, phase2_eval, context)
    PE-->>ORC: phase3_eval

    ORC->>HC: run(question, context, {all agents + phase3_test})
    HC->>LLM: generate(synthesis_prompt)
    LLM-->>HC: JSON {final_diagnosis, confidence, reasoning, supporting_evidence}
    HC-->>ORC: final_result

    ORC->>PE: evaluate_phase4(final_result, phase3_eval, all_evals, context)
    PE-->>ORC: phase4_eval + pipeline_test_summary

    ORC->>SA: run(question, context, {all agent results + latency})
    SA->>LLM: generate(system_analysis_prompt)
    LLM-->>SA: AnalysisReport {retrieval, agents, final, hallucination, confidence, aggregated}
    SA-->>ORC: analysis_report

    ORC-->>ORC: recalibrate confidence from analysis_report
    ORC-->>ORC: build agent_outputs list (6 IndividualAgentOutput)
```

