## 4. RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph INGEST["📥 Index Build (Startup / POST /load-data)"]
        direction TB
        CSV1[FailureSensorIQ CSV\n500 rows sampled + 30 synthetic]
        CSV2[AFRB CSV\nAll columns → text doc]
        PARSE[Row → Structured Text\nequipment, failure_mode,\nsensors, severity, action]
        EMB1[Embedder\nSentenceTransformer\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2\n384-dim vectors]
        IDX[FAISS IndexFlatL2\nadd embeddings]
        DISK[faiss_indexes/\nfailure_iq.faiss\nafrb.faiss\n*.pkl doc store]
        CSV1 --> PARSE --> EMB1 --> IDX --> DISK
        CSV2 --> PARSE
    end

    subgraph QUERY["🔍 Query Time (POST /query)"]
        direction TB
        Q[User Question] --> QEMB[Embed Query\n1×384 vector]
        QEMB --> SEARCH[FAISS.search\nL2 distance top-k]
        SEARCH --> SCORE[score = 1/(1+dist)\n0→1 similarity]
        SCORE --> DOCS[Top-K Documents\n{content, metadata, score}]
        DOCS --> CTX[BaseAgent.format_context\nNumbered text blocks]
    end

    DISK -->|_load on startup| SEARCH
    CTX -->|Retrieved Context| AGENTS[6 AI Agents\nuse context as evidence]
```

---

## 5. LLM Client — Decision & Fallback Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    CALL[Agent calls\nllm_client.generate] --> PROV{LLM_PROVIDER\nenv var}

    PROV -->|openai| KEYCHECK{API Key\nset & valid?}
    KEYCHECK -->|No| MOCK
    KEYCHECK -->|Yes| OAI[POST openai/chat/completions\ngpt-4o / gpt-4o-mini\nJSON mode + 8192 tokens\ntemp=0.2]
    OAI -->|HTTP Error / Timeout| MOCK
    OAI -->|Success| PARSE

    PROV -->|ollama| OLL[POST ollama/api/generate\nllama3 / mistral\nstream=false\nnum_predict=1024]
    OLL -->|ConnectError / Empty| MOCK
    OLL -->|Success| PARSE

    MOCK[Rule-Based Fallback Engine\n_build_agent_mock\nDetect agent from prompt keywords\nGenerate schema-correct JSON\nKeyword → diagnosis mapping:\nvibration→Bearing Wear\ntemp→Thermal Degradation\npressure→Cavitation\nbearing→Lubrication Fail\nelectrical→Winding Fault\nsensor→Anomaly] --> PARSE

    PARSE[extract_json\n1.Direct json.loads\n2.Markdown fence regex\n3.Brace-depth scanner] --> RESULT[Dict returned\nto calling Agent]
```

