## 8. API Communication Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant AX as api.js (Axios)
    participant FA as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as SQLite DB

    Note over UI,DB: Startup Health Check
    UI->>AX: checkHealth()
    AX->>FA: GET /health
    FA-->>AX: {status, failure_iq_loaded, afrb_loaded}
    AX-->>UI: Update dataStatus state

    Note over UI,DB: Dataset Load
    UI->>AX: loadDataset('failure_iq')
    AX->>FA: POST /load-data?dataset_type=failure_iq
    FA->>FA: Check disk cache → load or build FAISS
    FA-->>AX: {success, documents_loaded, message}
    AX-->>UI: setDataStatus({loaded: true})

    Note over UI,DB: AFRB CSV Upload
    UI->>AX: loadDataset('afrb', File)
    AX->>FA: POST /load-data?dataset_type=afrb\n(multipart/form-data)
    FA->>FA: Save file to uploads/ → build FAISS
    FA-->>AX: {success, documents_loaded}

    Note over UI,DB: Diagnostic Query (main flow)
    UI->>AX: sendQuery(question, 'failure_iq', 5)
    AX->>FA: POST /query {question, dataset_type, top_k}
    FA->>FA: FAISS.search → 6-agent pipeline → evaluation
    FA->>DB: BackgroundTask: save_analysis()
    FA-->>AX: QueryResponse (full JSON)
    AX-->>UI: Render DiagnosisCard + Panels

    Note over UI,DB: Analytics Dashboard
    UI->>AX: getAnalyses(50)
    AX->>FA: GET /analyses?limit=50
    FA->>DB: SELECT * FROM analysis_results
    DB-->>FA: rows
    FA-->>AX: {records, count}

    UI->>AX: getAgentReport(200)
    AX->>FA: GET /analyses/agent-report
    FA->>DB: get_agent_aggregates()
    FA-->>AX: Per-agent trait + metric aggregates
    AX-->>UI: Render AgentPerformanceReport
```

