## 9. Agent Persona & Evaluation Framework

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph PERSONAS["6 Agent Personas — Trait Matrix"]
        DE["🧠 Dr. Elena Vasquez\nDiagnostic Expert\nAnalytical Depth: 10/10\nEvidence Rigor: 10/10\nSpeed: 4/10"]
        PR["🔍 Dr. Aisha Patel\nPattern Recognition\nPattern Matching: 10/10\nEvidence Rigor: 7/10\nSpeed: 6/10"]
        AD["⚡ Commander Marcus Chen\nAggressive Decision\nSpeed: 10/10\nDecision Confidence: 10/10\nAnalytical Depth: 4/10"]
        VA["✅ Priya Raman\nVerification Analyst\nEvidence Rigor: 10/10\nRisk Awareness: 9/10\nAnalytical Depth: 9/10"]
        AM["🎯 Dr. Sofia Nakamura\nAmbiguity Detection\nUncertainty Handling: 10/10\nRisk Awareness: 10/10\nDecision Confidence: 3/10"]
        HC["🏁 Director Sarah Mitchell\nHuman Review Coord\nConsensus Building: 10/10\nDecision Confidence: 9/10\nEvidence Rigor: 8/10"]
    end

    subgraph METRICS["LLM-as-a-Judge Metrics (per agent)"]
        F[Faithfulness Score\nClaims grounded in context?]
        R[Reasoning Score\nCausally sound logic?]
        A[Agreement Score\nAligns with peer agents?]
        C[Coverage Score\nAddresses all key signals?]
        H[Hallucination Rate\nInvented facts?]
        REL[Reliability Score\nActionable & calibrated?]
    end

    subgraph VERDICT["Verdict System"]
        PASS["PASS ✅\nOverall ≥ 0.78"]
        PARTIAL["PARTIAL ⚠️\nOverall 0.60–0.77"]
        FAIL["FAIL ❌\nOverall < 0.60"]
    end

    subgraph PIPELINE_SCORE["Pipeline Score"]
        P1S[Phase 1 Score\nAvg of 3 agents]
        P2S[Phase 2 Score\nVerification + bonus]
        P3S[Phase 3 Score\nAmbiguity + calibration bonus]
        P4S[Phase 4 Score\nCoord × 0.85 + conf × 0.15]
        TOTAL[Pipeline Score\nAvg of 4 phases\n≥0.75 PASSED\n≥0.58 PARTIAL\n<0.58 FAILED]
    end

    DE & PR & AD & VA & AM & HC --> METRICS
    METRICS --> VERDICT
    P1S & P2S & P3S & P4S --> TOTAL
```

