## 11. Confidence Scoring & Decision Loop

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Agent Pipeline Produces\nraw confidence from\nHumanReviewCoordinator] --> B[Clamp to 0.0–1.0]
    B --> C[SystemAnalysisAgent runs\nInlineEvaluationReport]
    C --> D{analysis_report has\nconfidence_score?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Recalibrate:\nfinal_confidence = analysis_report.confidence.confidence_score]
    D -->|No| F[Keep coordinator confidence]
    E --> G
    F --> G

    G{Confidence Threshold\nCheck}
    G -->|≥ 0.75| H[🟢 High Confidence\nFollow recommendation directly]
    G -->|0.50–0.74| I[🟡 Moderate Confidence\nVerify with additional inspection]
    G -->|< 0.50| J[🔴 Low Confidence\nHuman expert review recommended\nambiguity=true flag]

    H --> K[API Response]
    I --> K
    J --> L[AmbiguityDetectionAgent\nhuman_review_required=true] --> K

    K --> M[Frontend renders\nConfidenceBar color-coded\nAmbiguity warning banner\nPhase test panel scores]

    M --> N{User satisfied?}
    N -->|No - new query| O[New question\nrestarted pipeline]
    N -->|Yes| P[✅ Analysis saved\nto SQLite async]
    P --> Q[AgentPerformanceReport\nupdated in /analysis dashboard]
    Q --> R{Feedback loop:\nBaseline vs Actual scores}
    R --> S[Trait-weighted expected scores\ncompared to real pipeline scores]
    S --> T[Best/Worst agent identified\nper metric dimension]
```

---

## 12. Module-wise Input/Output Summary

| Module | Input | Output | Technology |
|---|---|---|---|
| `FailureIQLoader` | CSV path / synthetic | `List[{content, metadata}]` | Python csv, random |
| `AFRBLoader` | CSV file path | `List[{content, metadata}]` | pandas, pathlib |
| `Embedder` | `List[str]` texts | `np.ndarray (N×384)` | sentence-transformers |
| `FAISSStore.build_index` | name + doc list | Saved `.faiss` + `.pkl` | FAISS IndexFlatL2 |
| `FAISSStore.search` | query str + top_k | `List[{content, score, metadata}]` | FAISS + numpy |
| `BaseAgent.run` | question + context | `Dict[str, Any]` structured result | LLMClient + httpx |
| `AgentOrchestrator.run` | question + dataset + docs | `QueryResponse` dict | asyncio + 7 agents |
| `evaluate_phase1/2/3/4` | agent results + context | Phase eval with score + verdict | LLM-as-a-Judge |
| `SystemAnalysisAgent` | all results + latency | `AnalysisReport` (7 sub-sections) | LLMClient |
| `save_analysis` | analysis_report + metadata | SQLite row id | sqlite3 |
| `get_agent_aggregates` | limit + filter | 6-agent trait + metric report | sqlite3 + math |
| `api.js sendQuery` | question + datasetType | `QueryResponse` JSON | axios POST |
| `ChatPage handleSubmit` | user input string | UI state update + message render | React useState |
| `AnalysisDashboard` | — | Charts + history + performance | GET /analyses + /agent-report |

---

## 13. Execution Pipeline — Step-by-Step Annotated

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    S1["① Startup\nlifespan():\n• init_db SQLite\n• Embedder load model\n• FAISSStore init\n• Load/build indexes"] --> S2

    S2["② User Visits\n/ Landing Page\nDataset selection\nHealth check"] --> S3

    S3["③ Dataset Load\nPOST /load-data\nCache check → FAISS\nbuild if needed"] --> S4

    S4["④ User Query\nPOST /query\n{question, dataset_type, top_k}"] --> S5

    S5["⑤ RAG Retrieval\nembed query\nFAISS.search top-5\nformat_context"] --> S6

    S6["⑥ Phase 1 Parallel\nasyncio.gather:\nDiagnosticExpert\nAggressiveDecision\nPatternRecognition"] --> S7

    S7["⑦ Phase 1 Eval\nLLM Judge ×3\nfaithfulness\nreasoning\ncoverage\nhallucination\nagreement\nreliability"] --> S8

    S8["⑧ Phase 2\nVerificationAnalyst\nreceives phase1_test\nresolves contradictions"] --> S9

    S9["⑨ Phase 3\nAmbiguityDetection\nconfidence calibration\nhuman_review flag"] --> S10

    S10["⑩ Phase 4\nHumanReviewCoord\nfinal synthesis JSON\nall prior context"] --> S11

    S11["⑪ Phase 5\nSystemAnalysis\nInlineEvaluationReport\nrecalibrate confidence"] --> S12

    S12["⑫ Background\nsave_analysis()\nSQLite persist\nanalysis_report JSON"] --> S13

    S13["⑬ HTTP Response\nQueryResponse\nfinal_diagnosis\nconfidence\nreasoning[]\nagent_outputs[6]\nphase_test_results"] --> S14

    S14["⑭ Frontend Render\nDiagnosisCard\nConfidenceBar\nReasoningAccordion\nAgentContributions\nPersonaOutputs\nPhaseTestPanel"]
```
